B.acC=new A.iE("Eid al-Adha Mubarak","The greatest day in the sight of Allah. Takbir, sacrifice, family \u2014 and remember: it is neither the meat nor the blood that reaches Him, but your taqwa.","Sunan Ibn Majah 3126 \xb7 Quran 22:37")
