B.b5t=new A.cN(B.apV,"Alif (\u0627) \u2014 From the empty space of the mouth \u2014 open it fully. You meet it in words like \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647. Open the Letters school in the Academy and tap 'Alif' \u2014 you will see the letter, hear it in a verse, and practice it step by step. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
