B.b2K=new A.cN(B.ax6,"\u1e24\u0101 (\u1e25) \u2014 Deep in the throat, a gentle breath. You meet it in words like \u0627\u0644\u0631\u064e\u0651\u062d\u0652\u0645\u064e\u0670\u0646. Open the Letters school in the Academy and tap '\u1e24\u0101' \u2014 you will see the letter, hear it in a verse, and practice it step by step. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
