B.a24=new A.fG(u.P,"Sahih Muslim 2877")
B.a2n=new A.fG("Your Lord has written mercy upon Himself.","Quran 6:54 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a2c=new A.fG("O My servants who believe \u2014 indeed, My earth is spacious, and My mercy encompasses all things.","Quran 29:56 \xb7 7:156 \u2014 excerpts")
B.a2f=new A.fG("The dua of Yunus from inside the whale: La ilaha illa anta, subhanaka, inni kuntu minaz-zalimin \u2014 and Allah answered him. He answers you too.","Quran 21:87\u201388")
B.a29=new A.fG("Ya\u2019qub \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 lost his sight from grief and said only: I complain of my sorrow and grief to Allah.","Quran 12:86 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a2l=new A.fG("The Prophet \ufdfa, in his hardest year, was told: Your Lord has neither forsaken you nor does He hate you. And the Hereafter is better for you than the first.","Quran 93:3\u20134")
B.a27=new A.fG("Fear not \u2014 I am with you both; I hear and I see.","Quran 20:46 \u2014 Allah to Musa and Harun")
